WEBVTT

00:09:29.329 --> 00:09:31.662
what are you doing? You
can't give up too soon.

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:35.037
Everyone's going to think you're a
quitter and a failure, a failure.

00:09:35.037 --> 00:09:37.162
You won't find a better opportunity

00:09:37.537 --> 00:09:41.496
at some point. You just have to
say it's over. Let it go.

00:09:42.412 --> 00:09:46.204
But that's easier said than done.
Just ask Janice Burch.

00:09:46.621 --> 00:09:50.746
I was so scared, I don't
ever remember being

00:09:50.746 --> 00:09:56.412
so scared to do anything then to tell
my supervisor that I wanted to quit.

00:09:57.037 --> 00:09:59.746
Janice has one of the most practical
strategies I've seen

00:09:59.746 --> 00:10:04.121
for escaping escalation of commitment.
But she didn't discover it overnight.